{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "1CH",
 "chapter": 26,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.1",
   "range": "1CH.26.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a47cc7ac",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.1#p1-a47cc7ac",
     "text": "This Asaph was not the notable musician, but another of that name also called Ebiasaph in 1Ch 6:23,37,9:19 and also Jasaph.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Asaph",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:23,37,9:19",
       "ref": "1CH.6.23"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:23,37,9:19",
       "ref": "1CH.6.37"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:23,37,9:19",
       "ref": "1CH.9.19"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.5",
   "range": "1CH.26.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "de735bef",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.5#p1-de735bef",
     "text": "In giving him many children.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "blessed him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.6",
   "range": "1CH.26.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b8b17a40",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.6#p1-b8b17a40",
     "text": "Or, like their father's house, meaning, worthy men and valiant.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "ruled throughout the house of their"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.8",
   "range": "1CH.26.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2ea88838",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.8#p1-2ea88838",
     "text": "Fit to serve the office of the portership.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "strength for the service"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.12",
   "range": "1CH.26.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bd58b9ca",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.12#p1-bd58b9ca",
     "text": "According to their turns as well the one as the other.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "against another"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.14",
   "range": "1CH.26.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0e1d1d22",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.14#p1-0e1d1d22",
     "text": "One expert and fit to keep that gate.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "a wise counsellor"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.15",
   "range": "1CH.26.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8ff82fce",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.15#p1-8ff82fce",
     "text": "This was a house where they used to resort to consult things concerning the temple, as a convocation house.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "Asuppim"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.16",
   "range": "1CH.26.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4f1366c3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.16#p1-4f1366c3",
     "text": "At which they used to cast out the filth of the city.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "Shallecheth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.17",
   "range": "1CH.26.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "dcae4166",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.17#p1-dcae4166",
     "text": "Meaning two one day and two another.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "two and two"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.18",
   "range": "1CH.26.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bf7a89f2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.18#p1-bf7a89f2",
     "text": "Which was a house in which they kept the instruments of the temple.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "Parbar westward"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.23",
   "range": "1CH.26.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6d33b76f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.23#p1-6d33b76f",
     "text": "These also had charge over the treasures.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "Amramites"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.26",
   "range": "1CH.26.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5950b5ed",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.26#p1-5950b5ed",
     "text": "According as the Lord commanded, Nu 31:28.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "dedicated",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 31:28",
       "ref": "NUM.31.28"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.29",
   "range": "1CH.26.29",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bb798ee9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.29#p1-bb798ee9",
     "text": "Meaning of things that were out of the city.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "over Israel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.30",
   "range": "1CH.26.30",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5e9256e0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.30#p1-5e9256e0",
     "text": "That is, for the king's house.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "the king"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.26.32",
   "range": "1CH.26.32",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3e4cbd3c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.26.32#p1-3e4cbd3c",
     "text": "Both in spiritual and temporal things.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "God"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
